{"exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1.5,"trans":true,"layer":"bg","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"scaleY":1.5,"x":-500,"mirrow":false,"y":-125,"img":"bgblack","addImg":""},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":0.4,"scaleX":1.5,"trans":true,"layer":"bg","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1.5,"x":-500,"mirrow":false,"y":-125,"img":"bgblack","addImg":""},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"x":220,"mirrow":false,"y":-154,"img":"chara045_1","addImg":"chara045_1_face_chara045_1e"},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1,"x":220,"mirrow":false,"y":-154,"img":"chara045_1","addImg":"chara045_1_face_chara045_1e"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"艾尔菲帕","text":"[show]唉……可能因为我的头发比较蓬松，被一群小鸟缠上了。它们总爱把我的脑袋当鸟巢……真是一群坏家伙。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara045_1_face_chara045_1d"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"艾尔菲帕","text":"[show]每次被当成鸟巢之后，我也没法直接赶走它们……一是它们太灵活，赶走了也会马上回来，还啄我的头……二是我也不想动用魔法伤害它们。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara045_1_face_chara045_1f"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"艾尔菲帕","text":"[show]所以最简单的方法，反而是站着不动，等它们呆腻飞走之后就好了。[r]可这样太耽搁我的时间了，我还有好多事儿想做呢……[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara045_1_face_chara045_1c"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"艾尔菲帕","text":"[show]你说，所以最好的方法，就是在它们缠上我之前把它们赶跑？[r]唔，说得也有道理……不愧是脑袋聪敏的工匠。那个，可以请你来帮我吗？[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"艾尔菲帕","text":"[show]嗯？那边好像传来了小鸟的声音。我们得做好准备了，战友……！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"}],"des":"艾尔菲帕-友善3","script":"yd_045_03"}